{"id":"topor","lemma":"топор","pos":"noun","rank":3510,"glosses":["axe, ax, hatchet"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b1/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"топора","plural":"топоры"},"examples":[{"text":"Это топор.","en":"This is an ax.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Мы закопали топор войны.","en":"We buried the hatchet.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,null,{"g":"war, warfare","l":"война"}]},{"text":"Давайте закопаем топор войны.","en":"Let's bury the hatchet.","words":[{"g":"to let"},null,null,{"g":"war, warfare","l":"война"}]},{"text":"Пришло время зарыть топор войны.","en":"It's time to bury the hatchet.","words":[{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"},{"g":"time"},null,null,{"g":"war, warfare","l":"война"}]},{"text":"Когда-то мы были врагами, но мы зарыли топор войны, и теперь мы друзья.","en":"At one time we were enemies, but we've buried the hatchet and we are now on friendly terms with each other.","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"were","l":"быть"},{"g":"enemy, foe","l":"враг"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"we"},null,null,{"g":"war, warfare","l":"война"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"now, at present"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"}]}]}